41), Accounting (A016), Accounting (A017) or Accounting (C191).</p><p class=\"cam\">Enrollment limited to students in the  Oregon State - Corvallis campus.</p>", "corequisites": "", "department_approval_required": "", "recommendations": "", "fees": "", "attribute_description": "", "books_html": "", "clssnotes": "<p>ACTG 379 must be completed on declared campus. \n<p><a href=\"http://oregonstate.edu/registrar/rtfiles/q.html?\n:&202701&ACTG&379&001&19141\" target=\"blank\">Textbooks</a></p>", "meeting_html": "<div class=\"meet\">MW 12pm-1:50pm<span class=\"meet-room-202701\"> in <a href=\"https://map.oregonstate.edu/?id=2243#!m/1027675?share\" target=\"_blank\">AUST 260 - Austin Hall 260</a></span><span class=\"meet-dates\"> (9/23 to 12/4)</span></div>", "exams_html": "", "instructordetail_html": "<div class=\"instructor-detail\">Heather Pesch</div>", "all_sections": "<div class=\"course-sections\" role=\"grid\" aria-readonly=\"true\"><div role=\"row\"><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">CRN</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Section #</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Campus</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Meets</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Type</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Max Enrl</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Actual Enrl</div></div><a role=\"row\" href=\"#\" class=\"course-section\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:ACTG 379\" data-srcdb=\"202701\" data-key=\"crn:19141\"><div role=\"rowheader\" class=\"course-section-crn\"><span class=\"header-text\">CRN: </span> 19141</div><div role=\"gridcell\" class=\"course-section-section\"><span class=\"header-text\">Section #: </span> 001</div><div role=\"gridcell\" class=\"course-section-camp\"><span class=\"header-text\">Campus: </span> Corvallis</div><div role=\"gridcell\" class=\"course-section-mp\"><span class=\"header-text\">Meets: </span> MW 12-1:50p</div><div role=\"gridcell\" class=\"course-section-schd\"><span